    "statusLabel": "REFERENCE ARCHITECTURE",
    "overviewSummary": "A production cluster from the internet to the disk. A cloud L4 load balancer passes TLS traffic to the Envoy ingress gateway, which routes by host and path into the service mesh. Every pod has an Istio sidecar, so pod-to-pod calls are mutual TLS with certificates handed out by istiod. The API finds services through CoreDNS and keeps state in a Postgres StatefulSet on Ceph volumes, with uploads and nightly backups in Ceph object storage.",
