            "title": "Spread out",
            "text": "3 zones; disruption budgets keep 2 pods up.",
            "icon": "check"
          },
          {
            "title": "Autoscale",
            "text": "api HPA: 3 to 10 pods on CPU and RPS.",
            "icon": "info"
          },
          {
            "title": "State is special",
